# Examples — Reference Project Books

This directory is a placeholder for **example project books** from
previous students (in any format: PDF, DOCX, etc.). Upload them
here and they will be used as the style reference for tightening
this book to a normal, reasonable size — instead of the current
~250-page version.

Once examples are uploaded, the book will be rewritten to match
their tone, depth, and length, and aligned with the rubric
(`guidelines/מחוון לפרויקט.pdf`) rather than the stricter
submission procedure (`guidelines/נוהל הגשת פרויקט (1).pdf`).
